{
  "name": "typst-format-panel",
  "displayName": "Typst Format Panel",
  "description": "Interactive side panel for Typst editing in VSCode: text formatting, math symbols, tables, grids and a fully customizable custom tab. English and French UI.",
  "icon": "media/icon.png",
  "version": "0.1.4",
  "publisher": "mmaunier",
  "author": {
    "name": "Mikaël Maunier",
    "email": "mmaunier2009@gmail.com"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/mmaunier/typst-format-panel.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/mmaunier/typst-format-panel/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/mmaunier/typst-format-panel#readme",
  "keywords": [
    "typst",
    "typst-lsp",
    "tinymist",
    "formatting",
    "math",
    "sidebar",
    "webview",
    "i18n",
    "french"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.80.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Formatters"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:typst"
  ],
  "main": "./src/extension.js",
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "echo 'No compilation needed'",
    "package": "vsce package --out build/",
    "build": "vsce package --out build/"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/vscode": "^1.80.0",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^2.32.0"
  },
  "contributes": {
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Typst Format Panel",
      "properties": {
        "typstFormatPanel.language": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["auto", "en", "fr"],
          "default": "auto",
          "description": "Interface language for the side panel. 'auto' follows VSCode's display language and falls back to English if unsupported.",
          "markdownDescription": "Interface language for the side panel.\n\n- `auto` — follow VSCode's `env.language` (defaults to English if unsupported).\n- `en` — force English.\n- `fr` — force French.\n\nAdditional languages can be added by dropping a `<lang>.json` file in the extension's `src/i18n/` directory."
        },
        "typstFormatPanel.persoButtons": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [
            {
              "type": "titre",
              "texte": "Mes commandes"
            },
            {
              "type": "bouton",
              "texte": "Titre §",
              "commande": "= $1$0"
            },
            {
              "type": "bouton_variantes",
              "defaut": 1,
              "variantes": [
                {
                  "texte": "Cadre simple",
                  "commande": "#block(stroke: 1pt, inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[$1]$0"
                },
                {
                  "texte": "Cadre coloré",
                  "commande": "#block(fill: luma(230), inset: 8pt, radius: 4pt)[$1]$0"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "description": "Custom buttons for the Perso tab.",
          "markdownDescription": "Custom buttons for the Perso tab.\n\n**Available types:**\n\n1. **Type `titre`** — section title\n   ```json\n   {\"type\": \"titre\", \"texte\": \"My title\"}\n   ```\n\n2. **Type `bouton`** — simple button\n   ```json\n   {\"type\": \"bouton\", \"texte\": \"Section\", \"commande\": \"= $1$0\"}\n   ```\n\n3. **Type `bouton_variantes`** — button with a right-click context menu\n   ```json\n   {\n     \"type\": \"bouton_variantes\",\n     \"defaut\": 1,\n     \"variantes\": [\n       {\"texte\": \"Bold stars\", \"commande\": \"*$1*$0\"},\n       {\"texte\": \"Bold function\", \"commande\": \"#strong[$1]$0\"}\n     ]\n   }\n   ```\n\n**Placeholders:** `$1` = selected text, `$0` = final cursor position, `\\n` = newline.",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["titre", "bouton", "bouton_variantes"]
              },
              "texte": { "type": "string" },
              "commande": { "type": "string" },
              "defaut": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
              "variantes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "texte": { "type": "string" },
                    "commande": { "type": "string" }
                  },
                  "required": ["texte", "commande"]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": ["type"]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "typst-format-container",
          "title": "Typst Format",
          "icon": "media/icon.svg",
          "when": "typst-format-panel:enabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "typst-format-container": [
        {
          "icon": "media/icon.svg",
          "id": "typstFormatPanel",
          "name": "Typst Format",
          "type": "webview",
          "when": "typst-format-panel:enabled"
        }
      ]
    },
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "typstFormat.commentTypst",
        "title": "Typst: Comment selection",
        "category": "Typst Format"
      },
      {
        "command": "typstFormat.uncommentTypst",
        "title": "Typst: Uncomment selection",
        "category": "Typst Format"
      },
      {
        "command": "typstFormat.hidePanel",
        "title": "Typst: Hide the side panel",
        "category": "Typst Format"
      },
      {
        "command": "typstFormat.editPersoButtons",
        "title": "Typst: Edit custom buttons",
        "category": "Typst Format"
      }
    ]
  }
}
